REUSABLE TASK STARTER

I want to work on the following task:
[Describe what I need.]
Context, if known: [Audience, deadline, required format, and source material or files.]
Apply the execution protocol, scaled to the size and risk of this task.
Start by understanding the objective and identifying any questions you need answered. Do not jump straight into execution.
Challenge my approach where appropriate, recommend the best solution, and ensure the final deliverable meets a high professional standard.
My priority is quality, accuracy, and practical usability.

endstream
